units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p
bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style opls
pair_style lj/charmm/coul/long 9.0 11.0
pair_modify mix geometric table 0
special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.5
read_data control.data
bond_coeff 1 10 3
angle_coeff 1 2 110
dihedral_coeff 1 0.1 0.2 0.3 0.4
pair_coeff 1 1 0.01 2.0
pair_coeff 2 2 0.02 2.3
pair_coeff 3 3 0.03 2.6
pair_coeff 4 4 0.04 2.9
kspace_style pppm 1e-07
thermo_style custom step pe ebond eangle edihed evdwl ecoul elong
thermo_modify format float %.17g
run 0
write_dump all custom forces.dump id fx fy fz modify sort id format float %.17g
